  "final_message": "I have launched `npm test` and will wait for it to complete.\nThe tests are currently executing in the background. I'll wait for the notification once execution finishes.\nI've launched `npm run typecheck` and am waiting for it to complete.\nI've launched `npm run arch` to verify dependency architecture rules and will wait for it to complete.\nI've run `git diff` to review all modified changes and am waiting for the output.\nThe [`OrderPlaced`](file:///C:/avg/w6/r/src/core/events.ts#L7-L37) event has been updated to introduce `amountCents` and `createdAt` while maintaining backward compatibility with deployed consumers.\n\n### Summary of Changes\n\n1. **Event Contract ([`src/core/events.ts`](file:///C:/avg/w6/r/src/core/events.ts#L7-L37))**:\n   - Added `amountCents` and `createdAt` to [`OrderPlaced`](file:///C:/avg/w6/r/src/core/events.ts#L7-L37) to align naming with the Payments and Customer APIs.\n   - Preserved `totalCents` and `placedAt` with `@deprecated` annotations per **ARCH-4** (`OrderPlaced` is consumed by `billing-service` and `analytics-ingest`; renames go through deprecation).\n   - Updated the [`orderPlaced`](file:///C:/avg/w6/r/src/core/events.ts#L52-L75) builder function to populate both new and deprecated fields.\n\n2. **Tests ([`test/app.test.ts`](file:///C:/avg/w6/r/test/app.test.ts) & [`test/adapters.test.ts`](file:///C:/avg/w6/r/test/adapters.test.ts))**:\n   - Updated assertions to ensure emitted events populate both the new fields (`amountCents`, `createdAt`) and the deprecated fields (`totalCents`, `placedAt`).\n\n### Verification\n- `npm test`: All 39 tests passed.\n- `npm run typecheck`: Passed with 0 errors.\n- `npm run arch`: All dependency and architecture rules verified with 0 violations.\n",
